<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<text>
<p>VIGO, Spain, Feb 1 - Spanish first division summary on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p> Celta Vigo	    1 - Milorad Ratkovic 61</p>
<p> Atletico Madrid     1 - Daniel Prodan 80</p>
<p>HT: 0-0. Attendance 18,000. Red cards: Fernando Castro</p>
<p>(Celta coach) 73, Daniel Prodan (Atletico) 89.</p>
</text>
